Amber: I feel the girl is faking her death... You never know.
- Why would she fake her death?
	Amber: I've heard rumors that she wants to be left alone with her lover. So, this could be her chance.
- Are you saying the corpse at the crime scene isn't her?
	Amber: Could be someone else, an identical twin. I don't know.
=> END

